; Purpose: lossless CSV text, streamed rows, live views and mutable snapshots.
; File writes publish after validation and close; explicit dialects preserve
; Strings, duplicate rows and logical record positions.
; [tested: sh test.sh examples/ch08-data/08-03-the-shipped-libraries/17-csv_lib.metta; commit=WORKTREE].

